---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="此站如何搭建 · 鲁琦 Qi Lu"
  description="本站使用 Astro + Claude Code 搭建，本身就是 AI 协作能力的演示"
>
  <section class="head">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="kicker">PROCESS</p>
      <h1>
        <span class="lang-zh">这个网站<br/>怎么做的。</span>
        <span class="lang-en">How this site<br/>was built.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="intro">
        <span class="lang-zh">
          坦白说，<strong>这个作品集本身就是一份作品</strong>。
          我使用 <a href="https://claude.com/claude-code" class="inline-link">Claude Code</a> 在
          本地通过对话式协作搭起来——不到一晚上，从零到可部署。
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          Honestly — <strong>this portfolio is itself a piece of work</strong>.
          I built it locally with <a href="https://claude.com/claude-code" class="inline-link">Claude Code</a>
          through conversational pairing — under one evening, from zero to deployable.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p class="intro">
        <span class="lang-zh">
          放在这里不是为了显得"会写代码"——而是想直接展示：在 2026 年，
          当一位非纯前端背景的研究生需要一份个人站点时，<strong>怎样的协作流程是高效的</strong>。
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          It's not here to prove I "can code" — it's here to show, plainly, what
          <strong>an efficient AI-paired workflow looks like</strong> in 2026 for a graduate student who isn't a pure frontend engineer.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="block-title">
        <span class="lang-zh">技术选型</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Stack</span>
      </h2>
      <ul class="tech-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Astro 5</strong>
          <span class="lang-zh">静态优先，开启 View Transitions，包体积极小</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Static-first, View Transitions enabled, tiny bundle</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Content Collections + zod</strong>
          <span class="lang-zh">作品 frontmatter 严格校验</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Strict frontmatter validation for every work</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong><span class="lang-zh">原生 CSS + CSS 变量</span><span class="lang-en">Vanilla CSS + custom properties</span></strong>
          <span class="lang-zh">不引 Tailwind，深浅色模式只用变量切换</span>
          <span class="lang-en">No Tailwind; light/dark just toggles variables</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Vercel</strong>
          <span class="lang-zh">推 GitHub 自动构建部署，全球 CDN 分发</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Auto-builds and deploys on every GitHub push, served over a global CDN</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong><span class="lang-zh">无重型 JS</span><span class="lang-en">No heavy JS</span></strong>
          <span class="lang-zh">主题切换 + 列表展开 + 视图切换，加起来不到 3KB</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Theme toggle + list accordion + view switch — under 3KB total</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="block-title">
        <span class="lang-zh">协作流程</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Workflow</span>
      </h2>
      <ol class="flow">
        <li>
          <span class="flow-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h3>
              <span class="lang-zh">把需求写清楚</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Write the brief clearly</span>
            </h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-zh">
                我先列了一份很详细的需求文档：信息架构、字段、视觉风格、性能指标、目标受众。
                清晰的输入是 AI 协作的前提。
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                I started with a detailed spec: information architecture, fields, visual tone, performance targets, audience.
                A sharp brief is the entry condition for working with AI.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="flow-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h3>
              <span class="lang-zh">让 Claude Code 全量生成骨架</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Let Claude Code scaffold everything</span>
            </h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-zh">
                所有页面、组件、内容 schema、部署配置一次性产出。我做的事是<strong>读、检查、追问</strong>，
                而不是逐行写。
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Pages, components, content schema, deploy config — all generated in one pass. My job was to <strong>read, audit, ask follow-ups</strong>,
                not to write line by line.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="flow-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h3>
              <span class="lang-zh">本地跑起来 + 视觉微调</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Run locally and tune the visuals</span>
            </h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-zh">
                <code>npm run dev</code>，对着浏览器一点点抠间距和动效。
                这一步的判断必须我来做，AI 给不了。
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                <code>npm run dev</code>, then dial in spacing and motion against the browser.
                This step is a judgment call — AI can't replace it.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="flow-num">04</span>
          <div>
            <h3>
              <span class="lang-zh">持续更新</span>
              <span class="lang-en">Keep adding</span>
            </h3>
            <p>
              <span class="lang-zh">
                之后每加一个新作品，只需要在 <code>src/content/works/</code> 写一个 markdown 文件，
                重新 build 即可。
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Each new work is just one markdown file in <code>src/content/works/</code>, then rebuild.
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="block">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <h2 class="block-title">
        <span class="lang-zh">我的判断</span>
        <span class="lang-en">My take</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="intro">
        <span class="lang-zh">
          AI 在 2026 年已经是基础工具。<strong>真正区分人的是品味、判断、对问题的定义能力</strong>——
          这些不会被 AI 取代，反而被它放大。
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          By 2026 AI is a baseline tool. <strong>What actually differentiates people is taste, judgment, and the ability to frame a problem</strong> —
          AI doesn't replace those, it amplifies them.
        </span>
      </p>
      <p class="intro">
        <span class="lang-zh">
          如果你看到这里，欢迎 <a href="mailto:luqiapp2007@163.com" class="inline-link">写信给我</a>，
          我也很想知道你如何看待 AI 协作的边界。
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          If you've read this far, feel free to <a href="mailto:luqiapp2007@163.com" class="inline-link">drop me a line</a> —
          I'd love to hear where you draw the line on AI collaboration.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .head { padding: clamp(64px, 10vh, 120px) 0 32px; }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    line-height: 0.95;
  }
  .intro {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .intro strong { color: var(--fg); }
  .inline-link {
    color: var(--fg);
    border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--accent);
    transition: all var(--transition);
  }
  .inline-link:hover {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .block {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: var(--border-w-thick) solid var(--border);
  }
  .block.highlight { background: var(--bg-strong); }
  .block-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--fg);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    font-weight: 900;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
    border-bottom: var(--border-w-thick) solid var(--border);
  }
  .block-lede {
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .tech-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .tech-list li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 220px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--border);
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  .tech-list strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .flow {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .flow li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 72px 1fr;
    gap: 24px;
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--border);
  }
  .flow li:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
  .flow-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .flow h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--fg);
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .flow p {
    color: var(--fg-soft);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .flow code, .tech-list code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    background: var(--bg-strong);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 2px 6px;
    font-size: 0.875em;
    color: var(--fg);
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .flow li, .tech-list li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 8px; }
  }
</style>
